xt":"현재","x":1545,"y":435,"width":69,"height":32}]},{"text":"진행 중인 트랜잭션에 의해 변경된 데이터를 읽고자 할 때는 변경 이전 상대로 되돌린 버전을 읽는 것이다. 변경이","words":[{"text":"진행","x":189,"y":493,"width":50,"height":33},{"text":"중인","x":250,"y":493,"width":51,"height":33},{"text":"트랜잭션에","x":312,"y":493,"width":128,"height":32},{"text":"의해","x":451,"y":492,"width":49,"height":31},{"text":"변경된","x":513,"y":491,"width":73,"height":33},{"text":"데이터를","x":600,"y":491,"width":99,"height":32},{"text":"읽고자","x":710,"y":489,"width":76,"height":33},{"text":"할","x":796,"y":489,"width":27,"height":32},{"text":"때는","x":833,"y":489,"width":54,"height":31},{"text":"변경","x":897,"y":489,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"이전","x":962,"y":488,"width":53,"height":32},{"text":"상대로","x":1026,"y":488,"width":83,"height":33},{"text":"되돌린","x":1120,"y":488,"width":83,"height":31},{"text":"버전을","x":1216,"y":487,"width":88,"height":31},{"text":"읽는","x":1317,"y":486,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"것이다.","x":1390,"y":486,"width":103,"height":31},{"text":"변경이","x":1512,"y":485,"width":101,"height":32}]},{"text":"아직 확정되지 않은 값을 읽으려는 것이 아니므로 경우 lmk을 설정하지 않아도 된다. 따라서 읽는 세션과 변경하는","words":[{"text":"아직","x":187,"y":544,"width":50,"height":32},{"text":"확정되지","x":249,"y":544,"width":100,"height":32},{"text":"않은","x":361,"y":544,"width":51,"height":32},{"text":"값을","x":422,"y":544,"width":50,"height":31},{"text":"읽으려는","x":483,"y":543,"width":100,"height":32},{"text":"것이","x":592,"y":543,"width":47,"height":31},{"text":"아니므로","x":651,"y":542,"width":100,"height":31},{"text":"경우","x":760,"y":543,"width":52,"height":30},{"text":"lmk을","x":821,"y":541,"width":89,"height":31},{"text":"설정하지","x":921,"y":540,"width":102,"height":32},{"text":"않아도","x":1037,"y":539,"width":81,"height":32},{"text":"된다.","x":1128,"y":537,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"따라서","x":1204,"y":537,"width":82,"height":32},{"text":"읽는","x":1301,"y":536,"width":59,"height":32},{"text":"세션과","x":1372,"y":536,"width":96,"height":31},{"text":"변경하는","x":1481,"y":535,"width":1